etry-system predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3ac679b8b3bcfb15\" href=\"?note=3ac679b8b3bcfb15\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S\\)</span> (normal filter with its group operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3ac679b8b3bcfb15\" href=\"?note=3ac679b8b3bcfb15\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S\\)</span> (seven-argument hereditary-name predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"3ac679b8b3bcfb15\" href=\"?note=3ac679b8b3bcfb15\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S\\)</span> (name-evaluation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" href=\"?note=3a9a09c4855ab3f8\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation\">../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymmetricSubmodel}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{SymmetricSubmodel}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SymmetricSubmodel}_S(N,M,G,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\n\\exists\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,1_{\\mathbb P},\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M,\\preccurlyeq)\n\\land\\mathcal F\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S(\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nN=\n\\left\\{\nx:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,G,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}symmetric\\text{-}submodel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SymmetricSubmodel}_S(N,M,G,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{TransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\n\\exists\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,1_{\\mathbb P},\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a\\in M\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\n(\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,1_{\\mathbb P})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\mathrm{Generic}_S(G,\\mathbb P,M,\\preccurlyeq)\n\\land\\mathcal F\\in M\n\\land\\mathrm{SymmetrySystem}_S(\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a)\n\\land\\mathrm{NormalSymmetryFilter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathscr G,\\cdot)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nN=\n\\left\\{\nx:\n\\exists\\sigma\\in M\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{HereditarilySymmetricName}_S(\\sigma,\\mathbb P,\\preccurlyeq,\\mathscr G,\\cdot,a,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingNameEvaluation}_S(x,\\sigma,G,\\mathbb P)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The group operation and action are carried by the canonical symmetry-system predicate, and every hereditary-name call now uses its exact seven-argument signature.</li>\n<li>Name evaluation now carries the required forcing-poset argument; restricting names to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> makes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> a set in the ambient metatheory.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"3ac679b8b3bcfb15","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-hereditarily-symmetric-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a9a09c4855ab3f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-forcing-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"a9132c2c1a18acd1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[